            <div xml:id="m-d20a5db9-482d-401b-a38f-2aab845ecf19">
              <lg xml:id="m-9aa2433a-76ed-4755-9266-80c43621f942">
                <l xml:id="m-d19f6c30-535d-40c5-b3e9-7dc2b311bcec" facs="#m-d4421783-84a4-4291-aaca-5ff4036d632c" label="text-like">Sunday at Terce.</l><l xml:id="m-9d24922f-3c5c-4a4f-80bf-5ce6bad31aa4" facs="#m-d2d57527-8758-4531-9b24-9c885ef53732" label="ambiguous">237</l><l xml:id="m-1a8a2a6e-954a-4606-89a9-369c65d4d27f" facs="#m-1b796628-ed15-4af9-aa18-8fa16e434e9e" label="lyrics-like">Misericórdia túa Dómine pléna</l><l xml:id="m-6768514b-0e70-4019-9934-6a1c4282d7e4" facs="#m-5451a097-0f17-4b95-b487-f95daa723323" label="lyrics-like">Bónum mihi lex óris túi, * super</l><l xml:id="m-e3ac83c0-54cb-4692-b373-2fd56e67fb0c" facs="#m-bd5a48ca-7abe-463d-be42-cbe0938e117f" label="lyrics-like">est térra:*justificatiónes túas</l><l xml:id="m-601cf686-62c4-40e0-a6d2-12418c9245e9" facs="#m-6d10ad42-cb30-4539-b696-36bee549a085" label="lyrics-like">millia áuri et argénti.</l><l xml:id="m-fa17b210-208e-406d-8fb3-39d8622f1e5e" facs="#m-b366244b-bd5f-4105-bf24-0fc48e88337c" label="lyrics-like">Mánus túae fecérunt me, et plas¬</l><l xml:id="m-c1aa1983-79a0-4479-9801-1f03e1c737cd" facs="#m-c10717d9-3c26-4a9a-9139-d3fb46e6757b" label="lyrics-like">dóce me.</l><l xml:id="m-1dbf3a37-60b3-4e5b-a545-8317a1888c7f" facs="#m-b1f23701-5ab7-4867-a979-4a22796fcd40" label="lyrics-like">mavérunt me:*da mihi intel¬</l><l xml:id="m-a723da4e-4bfc-4f67-8546-884561bbabc3" facs="#m-e4688420-b974-4b9c-951b-19768fcd4e56" label="ambiguous">Psalm 118. V.</l><l xml:id="m-1638a2f9-62cb-45e8-9177-6c4b60e898b3" facs="#m-16a48ca2-9ff3-4e1d-b9e4-36bde7b9c709" label="lyrics-like">léctum, et discam mandáta túa.</l><l xml:id="m-71753b74-818e-46a4-ab49-546f44d8e309" facs="#m-74853634-817a-45cf-bfa0-d3fe91f9a16e" label="lyrics-like">Qui timent te vidébunt me, et</l><l xml:id="m-ab6e3e88-a79d-4130-835c-7a103ff7d935" facs="#m-f9ac1265-1408-4676-9fee-712b17638b1a" label="lyrics-like">DOnitátem fecisti cum sérvo túo</l><l xml:id="m-0b570f1b-2d82-4387-bada-98a58a58a34b" facs="#m-409719a3-b376-4669-918f-2688fb9fedbb" label="lyrics-like">lactabúntur: quia in vérba túa</l><l xml:id="m-75d79aea-2bc2-4852-ba96-2f1d099a69a8" facs="#m-9513f336-6825-4c17-a607-a2efc3d857f1" label="lyrics-like">D pómine,secúndum vérbum</l><l xml:id="m-269a1d13-2812-435d-8be5-7a1ef85594e7" facs="#m-a5dd96e1-dfab-4594-84b0-63dd26f52413" label="lyrics-like">supersperávi.</l><l xml:id="m-adf612df-b204-436e-b1d7-a21eaea18502" facs="#m-74070d25-87ea-4f6e-bf52-e7ac58976291" label="lyrics-like">túum.</l><l xml:id="m-58cb50ae-62cc-4053-ae39-532ede9c5424" facs="#m-ed24fdea-6423-450f-9638-c5adf9188959" label="lyrics-like">Cognóvi Dómine quia aéquitas</l><l xml:id="m-a6129bfa-3581-44aa-ab2c-c59fe758b3a1" facs="#m-f22ed0e2-e789-4ed7-8c7e-523209693302" label="lyrics-like">Bonitátem, et disciplinam, et</l><l xml:id="m-058b6a9e-cc22-434f-bd15-6e881d02489f" facs="#m-ea321745-049d-420e-a8c7-2f27229f9b9b" label="lyrics-like">judicia túa:“et in veritáte túa</l><l xml:id="m-46f30c7c-3c05-415d-8563-4323f1b17e64" facs="#m-e01c76cf-a203-4bf0-9e89-dfaf84e68b5a" label="lyrics-like">sciéntiam dóce me:? quia mandátis</l><l xml:id="m-0efcf466-fe24-4f77-98e5-940a63778ae4" facs="#m-448a02ca-4151-4e15-be4c-8fe2d8cb8f91" label="lyrics-like">humiliásti me.</l><l xml:id="m-5e98b9e3-6130-4363-b492-52d30b3e2746" facs="#m-f8fa3dc9-d818-4708-99ec-8c41e8f66930" label="lyrics-like">tuis erédidi.</l><l xml:id="m-6a02a3eb-e6f5-4c00-880d-f318c5ea841c" facs="#m-f4bc84b6-a274-4a2f-9f91-cc53d8d59959" label="lyrics-like">Fiat misericórdia túa ut conso¬</l><l xml:id="m-fb47c591-548a-48d6-b26c-bc930d0e1bec" facs="#m-9c160d3a-3bb9-4d54-bcaa-ebf9cf9d0c92" label="lyrics-like">Priúsquam humiliárer égo deli¬</l><l xml:id="m-feb05a23-e87e-4ff6-b0b2-f514268de462" facs="#m-360f20e7-937b-4fde-bacc-2496c8bb9d2f" label="lyrics-like">létur me, secúndum elóquium</l><l xml:id="m-be116d51-e2bb-4c83-adc0-0e88ddd72f98" facs="#m-7060a231-b789-4a09-8fc1-2714f2fc41c4" label="lyrics-like">qui: *proptérea elóquium túum</l><l xml:id="m-67a31664-480e-48f0-8121-fa4e53141992" facs="#m-24d7eeb0-504e-4c8c-bfa4-c165417cd34f" label="lyrics-like">túum sérvo túo.</l><l xml:id="m-bf57b9c4-d089-4508-8ec4-0f93d368d215" facs="#m-ec478955-9531-4797-a381-a14bd7fbe3cd" label="ambiguous">custodivi.</l><l xml:id="m-20a5c5e9-58dc-4a16-8695-2612d4bc6bd2" facs="#m-6a3427bc-4d09-4018-aad3-01ab37c95337" label="lyrics-like">Véniant mihi miseratiónes túae,</l><l xml:id="m-7fb1fdf9-6767-445c-906d-409f24a58545" facs="#m-cadb30af-5109-477d-9885-92d324a304fe" label="lyrics-like">Bónus és tu: * et in bonitáte</l><l xml:id="m-d94bc194-f581-452b-bbd8-88bd0ba4472e" facs="#m-0499c747-df34-47ca-8855-216e18e3af46" label="lyrics-like">et vivam:* quia lex túa meditátio</l><l xml:id="m-1547170c-9cb6-45e8-8354-d37efa230687" facs="#m-061fd260-0015-438f-bc92-bfc204db9855" label="lyrics-like">túa dóce me justificatiónes túas.</l><l xml:id="m-a36fd5ad-9c4a-4431-a557-f742f49f3fcc" facs="#m-b92baa17-8cd1-40ee-b090-93e2ad98a08f" label="lyrics-like">méa est.</l><l xml:id="m-d6fb4cd0-4d70-496a-b723-9498724b2515" facs="#m-ed799f02-12ea-4087-8485-893ccfb4d601" label="lyrics-like">Multiplicáta est super me iniqui¬</l><l xml:id="m-ac5f9678-716b-4455-b156-00398dc7ce9f" facs="#m-3e5621b1-3bd7-418e-b379-ee177d21ec5b" label="lyrics-like">Confundántur supérbi, quia iniú¬</l><l xml:id="m-4634a5cf-7e2d-495b-b9e0-cb88422f1e7b" facs="#m-83f56e26-c1a7-4613-ae70-a9fffbd2ca24" label="lyrics-like">tas superbórum: * égo autem in</l><l xml:id="m-3e831eec-adb3-4c21-9568-be0a6c46c96e" facs="#m-856df89c-68a3-47b5-994d-97a9e98650f2" label="lyrics-like">ste iniquitátem fecérunt in me:"</l><l xml:id="m-245dde53-bb2a-4655-a7bf-1d839a21f772" facs="#m-4b6b12a2-561f-444b-ab3b-2cae5e504b53" label="lyrics-like">tóto córde méo scrutábor mandáta</l><l xml:id="m-ea5accd2-c857-4fa3-8b3c-8b3caeb12b0c" facs="#m-5e6262fa-237a-47e4-8813-751642d220be" label="lyrics-like">túa</l><l xml:id="m-ec9c43ef-d9c6-4ea6-b2df-b037df959702" facs="#m-0e423a31-780d-4d1b-99f9-ec586e573a3f" label="lyrics-like">égo autem exercébor in mandátis</l><l xml:id="m-25747069-db0a-4c3e-89e1-c419821b82d9" facs="#m-e3bdc47a-c705-414c-9693-cb58300ccca7" label="lyrics-like">Coagulátum est sicut lac eór</l><l xml:id="m-a07b2fa7-0561-43cb-8c4c-053ecf814e55" facs="#m-d3d752d1-de9d-4c84-8fae-8c8b26807612" label="ambiguous">tuis.</l><l xml:id="m-f682120c-51a4-44a9-922a-d2a831da9388" facs="#m-ca2f9557-f211-4ce3-aebc-07bf21430951" label="lyrics-like">Convertántur mihi timéntes te:</l><l xml:id="m-32c9cb3a-584b-4f2b-a4ba-454b75b5b9ed" facs="#m-2a0988f3-cddd-4eaa-beb5-9843dde7154e" label="lyrics-like">eórum: *égo vero légem túam</l><l xml:id="m-741f114b-a943-499d-ad6b-1cff83e94d13" facs="#m-853a4d72-c3cc-4d9d-8368-a7308c794a34" label="lyrics-like">et qui novérunt testimónia túa.</l><l xml:id="m-ab616733-4cf7-47ab-92de-76d38cf915e3" facs="#m-3aaede7c-eca2-48ce-97fa-78ddbab24be9" label="lyrics-like">meditátus sum.</l><l xml:id="m-eba7030e-95a0-4f4f-97d2-90aa13062fce" facs="#m-16ddfb2d-5f90-4680-80dc-3274f291bf2c" label="lyrics-like">Bónum mihi quia humiliásti</l><l xml:id="m-8619a595-dfdd-4e5c-86ec-21d200cd2aef" facs="#m-e29b5700-36c6-441b-a01c-d6a988eaeff3" label="lyrics-like">Fiat cor méum immaculátum in</l><l xml:id="m-a9d62415-dc05-4e81-ad33-7cb4e478e656" facs="#m-2e118b3c-d9b8-4967-ada7-1fb5662ce665" label="lyrics-like">justificatiónibus túis, * ut non con¬</l><l xml:id="m-0b468e8b-b1d8-4af4-aeb5-dbb66a3afe89" facs="#m-f5bad91e-5894-4e74-b596-35c14a5dfb1b" label="lyrics-like">me: *ut díscam justificatiónes</l><l xml:id="m-03c00704-d6d1-416e-a3f3-3dceaf782d88" facs="#m-bf17400d-5877-4467-8a69-6755c2b82ca8" label="lyrics-like">fúndar.</l><l xml:id="m-20e917ac-2762-4a94-b4c3-0209b13bd09a" facs="#m-b794e7ef-5bfe-421b-a8cc-ceb3fac165b2" label="lyrics-like">túas.</l><l xml:id="m-c155584c-dbbb-4169-beea-8cca61faad14" facs="#m-34eba626-8127-4daa-8a91-69ed7cc9bf82" label="text-like">During the Year.</l><l xml:id="m-d5038459-cb02-4d3c-a993-f10b1fa96ca4" facs="#m-3e6c04df-92fc-466b-8b64-ca79e0ed86c3" label="ambiguous">ME</l><l xml:id="m-1914ef5f-87f4-44df-851c-ede1b8778986" facs="#m-8b5f4ef2-af0d-4543-abf9-1d6371dc14ea" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú-ia, déduc me Dómine in sémi-tam man¬</l><l xml:id="m-e831e06a-019f-45c5-8502-aa439bddf2a4" facs="#m-14563628-2d03-4a32-b491-013d2d2704bc" label="lyrics-like">da-tórum tu-órum, alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-7a44cb8f-333b-43a1-b847-abcef9f25452" facs="#m-84e66e29-6290-4c0b-a7ac-25481feff6c4" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-8dc12b75-4262-4b4c-9120-161ff27e392f" facs="#m-928c43ad-4a3b-413c-989d-411b6913848c" label="ambiguous">r. John. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-28e589ac-b8e4-4bf0-835a-5363143465ce" facs="#m-cdd9d148-6e9a-4531-a31b-e5b0a73d5dfb" label="lyrics-like">Eus cáritas est: t et qui] manet, *et Deus in eo.</l><l xml:id="m-46d57f72-8845-4c58-9a23-5de1aaa68807" facs="#m-21a4ca68-5b8e-4018-942a-f26b5336fddd" label="lyrics-like">K. Deo grátias.</l><l xml:id="m-ee7a7aae-2927-4a34-98ff-75f1fbc66d30" facs="#m-0208bb44-ff29-4015-84bc-8539cb1e70ab" label="lyrics-like">O manet in caritáte, in Deo!</l><l xml:id="m-c5f835b1-f58d-44f2-804b-43136da1112e" facs="#m-153cddc2-30c7-447b-b6a7-d0655fea940d" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-f417ecb6-db61-4bad-a8a5-4b58bcd12105" facs="#m-df5ae18b-d3a0-4dff-acd5-65f7267a3810" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-e618f055-0281-4d7c-9a71-d06292c89f68" facs="#m-d879a2b7-b008-4752-8d2a-194df088a04b" label="lyrics-like">Nclína cor mé-um, Dé-us,* In testimó-ni-a tú-a.</l><l xml:id="m-1b484cb6-7202-4f52-85a8-5ccf7a772f4b" facs="#m-63370a7f-4b1d-4c79-b652-e83fc1bdc439" label="lyrics-like">Repeat: Inclína. V. Avérte óculos mé-os, ne vide-ant va¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>